        {
          "from": "Proto-Baure-Muxojeóne *-ʧeni 'breast' (Muxojeóne mi-ʧeni)",
          "to": "Joaquiniano -ʃene, Baure -ʃena",
          "note": "Baure /ʃ/ arose from *ʧ before i and e; the Muxojeóne variety keeps ʧ."
